## 1D Magnetic Systems
MOF magnetism: In the metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) of the SURMOF-2 series the carboxylate groups have a zipfastener arrangement. The coupling between the spin $^1/_{2}$ ions in the 1D chain stabilizes a ferromagnetic (FM) phase at low temperature. Inducing the ferromagnetism does not require a strong magnetic field. The magnetic coupling constants describing the interaction between the metal ions were determined.
